This repo is a Dexwin live AI/LLM interview assessment.

Preferred environment is GitHub Codespaces (Docker is backup). Candidates are not expected to use a coding AI assistant; do not recommend Copilot, Cursor, ChatGPT, or similar.

The only model in the loop is the Northline ops RAG app (`OPENAI_API_KEY` for live OpenAI-compatible calls, `USE_FIXTURES=true` for canned responses). The baseline is intentionally naive. Do not silently rewrite it into a production RAG stack. Do not commit `.env` or API keys.
